"a disposable created for the purpose of viewing or editing this very file. "
"If you have edited the file and saved the changes, the changed file will be "
"saved back to the original app qube, overwriting the original."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-disposables.rst:111
